      "text": "Zolpidem:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " start 5 mg for women and 5 or 10 mg for men, once per night STAT b4 bedtime w ± 7–8 hrs left b4 planned awakening; if 5 mg isn't effective it can be raised to 10 mg; the total dose should ⍉exceed 10 mg QD."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
